data: {"id": "0314978a08124888-thinking-parallel_evidence-4251", "run_id": "0314978a08124888", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "已采集到 Pod 生命周期与诊断事实，汇总如下：\n\n### 实体身份与生命周期\n*   **Pod**: `aiops-case-10/workload-79d9f8fd88-bwqhh`\n*   **UID**: `f2db1889-e2c8-4073-b40b-7603dc0755f7`\n*   **Node**: `node2`\n*   **状态**: `Running` (Pod 对象仍在调度节点上，但 Container 处于崩溃重启状态)\n*   **重启次数**: `6` 次 (`CrashLoopBackOff`)\n\n### 异常现象 (支持 CrashLoopBackOffRuntime)\n1.  **Metrics**:\n    *   `kube_pod_container_status_restarts_total` 值为 6。\n    *   `kube_pod_container_status_last_terminated_reason` 为 `Error`。\n    *   容器退出码 (Exit Code) 为 `137` (SIGKILL)。\n2. ", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1788815053171, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

